      "text": "Why reconcile? GitHub sends no webhooks for\nreactions, and webhook deliveries can be\nmissed. Items that no longer match are deleted.",
      "originalText": "Why reconcile? GitHub sends no webhooks for\nreactions, and webhook deliveries can be\nmissed. Items that no longer match are deleted.",
